Croscore Fonts Attribution
--------------------------

The Standard 14 substitution fonts for the Times, Helvetica and Courier families are derived from the Croscore fonts Tinos, Arimo and Cousine:

    Digitized data copyright (c) 2010-2012 Google Corporation
